  "releaseNotes": "DarkTextBox's virtual keyboard popup now auto-closes when clicking away from it. Also: fix DarkDateTimePicker's dropdown calendar (dark theme forced on the native popup and its owning frame window, and the popup sized correctly to stop clipping the last week row/columns; added a ShowTime property for editing hour/minute directly in the text). Fix corner/border rendering across several controls (DarkNumericUpDown, DarkTabControl, DarkIoStatusTable); redesign DarkTextBox to fix vertical text centering and add unit suffix, numeric input mode with truncated decimals, and an optional virtual keyboard popup; add DarkIconKind.Keyboard.",
